{"sourceUrl":"https://sii.ecnu.edu.cn/c6/2d/c52126a771629/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.469697+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sii.ecnu.edu.cn/c6/2d/c52126a771629/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>华东师范大学智能交互学院面向智能时代“人与智能体”协同共生的新需求，依托华东师范大学在信息科学、设计学、心理与认知科学、传播学、教育技术等领域的多学科交叉优势，紧密结合上海建设具有全球影响力的科技创新中心战略及临港新片区在人工智能、数字经济、智能制造等方向的产业布局，重点布局智能装备与具身交互、社会模拟与智能体交互、休闲娱乐与智能交互三大特色方向。</span><br/></p><p><span>         <span><span><span><span>学院致力于培养系统掌握人工智能与人类认知行为科学基础理论、兼具交互设计能力与产业创新能力的</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>\"X</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>型</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>\"</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>复合人才，构建覆盖本科、硕士、博士和终身教育的多层次培养体系，推行产业导向、项目牵引的育人模式，打造国内领先、具有国际影响力的智能交互人才培养与产教融合高地。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>我院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>入学后，在临港校区开展学习科研工作。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>         <span><span><span><span>我院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年接收优秀应届毕业生免试攻读研究生（含本科直博），</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>预报名截止时间延长至</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>16:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>具体</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>工作安排通知如下：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://sii.ecnu.edu.cn/c6/2d/c52126a771629/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><strong>一、接收专业</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（一）专业学位硕士</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085410</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>人工智能（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（二）学术学位博士</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>083500</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>软件工程（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>081200</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>计算机科学与技术（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>081000</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>信息与通信工程（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>089901</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>数据科学与工程（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>050302</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>传播学（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>040203</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>应用心理学（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（三）专业学位博士</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085410</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>人工智能（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085402</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>通信工程</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>智能交互</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085403</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>集成电路工程 （智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085404</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>计算机技术（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085405</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>软件工程（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>045400</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>应用心理（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>055300</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>出版（智能交互）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>         <span><span><span><span>以上学科专业及研究方向仅供参考，我校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年推免专业目录最终以全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（网址：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，以下简称推免服务系统）公布为准。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>二、报名条件</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法、品德良好；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>已获得或预计获得就读学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学习成绩优异，具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质和专业基础；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>三、报名流程</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>（一）时间及方式</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>         <span><span><span><span>有意申请的考生即日起可登录华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5</span></span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，以下简称报名系统）注册账号，每位考生最多可注册两个账号，填报两条独立志愿。我院预报名截止时间为</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>16:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名截止前，考生可自行取消提交状态、修改完善后再次提交，请考生务必留意截止时间，尽早报名。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>（二）报名材料</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>有效居民身份证；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>预报名申请表（报名系统填写完毕后下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>诚信承诺书（报名系统下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>个人自述和佐证材料（以下材料请合并为一个</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）个人自述（包括但不限于个人简历，本科期间学习、科研、实践工作简介，研究生阶段学习研究计划和未来职业规划的初步设想）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）本科阶段成绩单（须加盖公章）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）本科阶段获奖证书、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等材料；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）外语能力水平证明，如大学英语四级或六级证书、雅思或托福等。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>四、其他说明</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>考生须保证提交材料真实、准确，不得弄虚作假，不得有学术不端行为。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>考生须密切关注报名系统中的审核状态及院系复试通知等信息。我院将组织专家对申请材料进行审核，遴选复试名单，并根据上级部门和学校政策规范组织复试考核工作。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读我校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年研究生的考生均须在正式取得推免资格后，在推免服务系统履行填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等正式程序。推免服务系统正式开放时间请及时关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>错过预报名的考生如仍有意愿报考我院，可在推免服务系统开通后直接报名。我院将结合实际，确定是否再次组织推免复试考核与录取。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>若上级部门对推免招生工作有新的要求，我院将遵照执行。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>五、咨询方式</strong></span></span></span><